[ti:Tiɣṛi idurar]
[ar:Lounès Matoub]
[al:Tirgin]
[length:3:31]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:15.77] Axxam aqdim wi t-yebnan
[00:20.46] Wi i as-yezlan
[00:23.87] Asfel mi yuli llsas-is
[00:27.37] Baba-k ɣeḑlen-t s laman
[00:31.26] Ur ak-t-mlan
[00:34.27] Asmi tettnadiḑ later-is
[00:37.39] Sikked kan legrad i asen-fkan
[00:39.70] I wid yeddmen rruḥ-is
[00:41.81] Ma d keččini fkan-ak leɛlam
[00:44.39] Deg yizenqan ttzuxxu yis
[00:46.43]
[00:55.71] Sikked kan legrad i asen-fkan
[00:58.22] I wid yeddmen rruḥ-is
[01:00.36] Ma d keččini fkan-ak leɛlam
[01:02.56] Deg yizenqan ttzuxxu yis
[01:06.36] Iqdimen nnuɣen xesren
[01:09.84] Kellxen-ten
[01:12.89] Asmi llin tawwurt i ccerq
[01:15.74] Deg unnar deg i ttmettaten
[01:19.36] Ay qeblen
[01:22.26] Rran aɛṛab d imsewweq
[01:25.10] Wigini terram d atmaten
[01:27.38] La tezzin aɛrur i lḥeqq
[01:29.58] Ma mazal tettamnem yis-sen
[01:31.88] Nekkini fɣeɣ d amnafeq
[01:34.17]
[01:43.07] Wigini terram d atmaten
[01:45.41] La tezzin aɛrur i lḥeqq
[01:47.63] Ma mazal tettamnem yis-sen
[01:49.78] Nekkini fɣeɣ d amnafeq
[01:53.25] Tidet ɣeḑren-tt yimawlan
[01:57.15] Mi tt-fkan
[02:00.09] Ɣer lbaṭel tedda d tislit
[02:03.48] Arrac ḥeffḑen ur ẓṛan
[02:07.23] Ayen uran
[02:09.97] Seg uyeffus a gma senṭeq-it
[02:13.29] Wigini yeṭṭfen imukan
[02:15.37] Wid i ten-yuklalen qlilit
[02:17.75] Ihi ma ttuɣ ayen iɛeddan
[02:20.19] Yemma mačči d taqbaylit
