[02:33.45] Wid i ten-yuklalen qlilit
[02:35.62] Ihi ma ttuɣ ayen iɛeddan
[02:37.98] Yemma mačči d taqbaylit
[02:42.01] Amek akka ara as-geɣ leqrar
[02:46.15] I uɛeṭṭar
[02:48.74] Yeččan tigemmi i yimawlan
[02:51.86] Ass-agi cebbḥen lɛaṛ
[02:56.00] Am lefnaṛ
[02:58.38] Attwalin yis iberdan
[03:01.34] Ma walan yekker-d ccaṭer
[03:03.63] Ad t-ɣeḑlen qbel ad d-iban
